[865.494845, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;114m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAgent\u001b[9G\"Run\u001b[14Gcraft:audit\"\u001b[27Gfinished\u001b[38;5;246m · 4m 10s\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mPhase 3 finished — \u001b[38;5;153m/craft:audit\u001b[39m post\u001b[40Gd verified requirements + \u001b[67Gest plan to COFFE-14\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;5;153m.artifacts/refined.md\u001b[39m). It found one contradiction and fixed\u001b[65Git rather than stopping: AC-6\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpromised\u001b[12Gthe banner\u001b[23Gshows \"the serv\u001b[39Gr's message\", but \u001b[38;5;153mApi.elm\u001b[65G\u001b[39muses \u001b[38;5;153mHttp.expectJson\u001b[39m,\u001b[87Gw\u001b[89Gich discards\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe body on non-2xx — so AC-6\u001b[33Gnow requir\u001b[44Gs\u001b[46Gthe app's existing wording. It also grew\u001b[87Gthe set to\u001b[98G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAC-1…AC-12 (wh\u001b[18Gt\u001b[20Gspace names, persiste\u001b[42Gce, double-submit,\u001b[61Gnetwork\u001b[69Gfailure)\u001b[78Gwith\u001b[83Gall\u001b[87G12\u001b[90Gcovered\u001b[98Gby\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B9\u001b[5Ge2e\u001b[9G+\u001b[11G2\u001b[13Gservice\u001b[21G+\u001b[23G1\u001b[25Gsplit.\u001b[32GDispatching\u001b[44Gphase\u001b[50G4.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;114m●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mAgent\u001b[22m(Run craft:forge)\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BBackgrounded agent\u001b[38;5;246m (↓ to manage · ctrl+o to expand)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;153m/artifact-design                     Design guidance and fundamentals for Artifacts.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m/craft:audit                         (craft) Audit the requirements against the real codebase\r\u001b[39C\u001b[1Band emit the test plan\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;246m/craft:render\u001b[17G          \u001b[28G     \u001b[34G  \u001b[37G   (craft) Build a clickable HTML prototype of the feature,\r\u001b[39C\u0